{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟公司表示，其旗艦軟件服務已全面恢復。此前發生的故障導致全球多地政府部門、交易員和企業的工作陷入停頓。微軟網站上的服務運行狀況更新顯示：「所有產品均已正常運行。」對於Microsoft 365服務，微軟表示，「積壓的電子郵件已經處理完畢，因此該問題已得到解決。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586400.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.130148+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:09:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_hash":"2e0f607bbb232eddf67ec85c534c7c9c48363532ee26f3de36d0d67c492df598","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}